:8,"key":false},{"kind":"tool","tool":"shell","title":"shell Get-Content -LiteralPath materials/reel2.zh-Hans.srt -Encoding UTF8","in":"Get-Content -LiteralPath materials/reel2.zh-Hans.srt -Encoding UTF8","out":"1\n00:00:05,167 --> 00:00:07,042\n好，开拍！\n\n2\n00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,875\n<i>正在越权接管记忆！</i>\n\n3\n00:00:14,333 --> 00:00:17,792\n哎呀，对不起！对不起…\n\n4\n00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,667\n听着，西利亚\n我们得追随各自的热爱\n\n5\n00:00:33,417 --> 00:00:40,375\n<i>你有你的机器人\n而我只想在太空里大展身手</i>\n\n6\n00:00:50,792 --> 00:00:53,125\n好了，他们来了\n\n7\n00:00:53,208 --> 00:00:54,833\n2分钟！\n\n8\n00:00:54,917 --> 00:00:56,292\n快点，戈登！\n\n9\n00:00:56,958 --> 00:00:58,375\n万岁，奇乔！\n\n10\n00:00:59,583 --> 00:01:02,667\n你为什么就不承认\n我的机器手把你吓坏了？\n\n11\n00:01:08,917 --> 00:01:13,167\n听着，西莉亚\n我那时年轻，还是个混蛋\n\n12\n00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:15,292\n但没理由毁灭世界\n\n13\n00:01:17,083 --> 00:01:18,208\n他为什么要这样？\n\n14\n00:01:19,625 --> 00:01:20,917\n我们还没试过那个！\n\n15\n00:01:23,625 --> 00:01:24,917\n放弃！\n\n16\n00:01:25,417 --> 00:01:26,250\n退后！","exit":0,"trunc":false,"i":9,"key":false},{"kind":"tool","tool":"shell","title":"shell ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration:stream=index,codec_name","in":"ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration:stream=index,codec_name,codec_type,width,height,r_frame_rate -of json materials/reel1.mp4","out":"{\n    \"programs\": [\n\n    ],\n    \"streams\": [\n        {\n            \"index\": 0,\n            \"codec_name\": \"h264\",\n            \"codec_type\": \"video\",\n            \"width\": 1280,\n            \"height\": 534,\n            \"r_frame_rate\": \"24/1\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"index\": 1,\n            \"codec_name\": \"aac\",\n            \"codec_type\": \"audio\",\n            \"r_frame_rate\": \"0/0\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"format\": {\n        \"duration\": \"70.024000\"\n    }\n}","exit":0,"trunc":false,"i":10,"key":false},{"kind":"tool","tool":"shell","title":"shell ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration:stream=index,codec_name","in":"ffpr